# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ShadRox environment variables
#
# Local development: copy this file to `.env` and fill in the values.
# Production: add them in Vercel -> Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables.
#
# Users bring their own Gemini/Groq key (BYOK) inside the app. These variables
# only power the built-in ShadRox key, which plan subscribers share and which is
# restricted to Pro-tier models. Leave them empty to keep ShadRox strictly BYOK.
#
# The shared-key path is additionally gated by SHADROX_ALLOW_SHARED_KEY below,
# so setting a key alone is not enough to start spending it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Master switch for every code path that spends ShadRox's own key. The beta
# runs BYOK-only, so this stays unset; an unkeyed request is then refused
# before the shared key is looked up. Set to "1" to re-enable at launch.
SHADROX_ALLOW_SHARED_KEY=""

# Shared key for requests that carry no BYOK key.
SHADROX_GROQ_API_KEY=""

# Optional fallback for the Groq key above. Either one is enough.
GROQ_API_KEY=""

# Shared Gemini key.
SHADROX_GEMINI_API_KEY=""

# Optional fallback for the Gemini key above.
GEMINI_API_KEY=""

# Optional: port for the local dev server (default 3000).
# PORT="3000"
